Description: Extracts tagged passages from Markdown and Word manuscripts for
    use in revision letters. Creates PDF, Word, or plain-text letters with
    reviewer comments and manuscript excerpts. The PDF format is based on
    papaja::revision_letter_pdf() and can include page references matched
    against the rendered manuscript.
